      "firstLineText": "An owner-private OrdinaryOutputPolicyPass tracks NarrativeStarted→NarrativeReturned→InterfaceStarted→InterfaceReturned, or Incomplete. It retains actual validator/files identity, actual route/iteration association supplied by the owning engine through a genuine private owner, ordered read observations/branch outcomes, exact issues (including warnings), and projection events. No caller accepted bool or string selects authority. Public ordinary validators still return their existing List<ValidationIssue>; internal detailed overloads used by the actual engine can retain the same invocation’s data. They must not invoke public validation twice.",
